{"title":"Two more notable books from 2025","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/934880681/0/marginalrevolution~Two-more-notable-books-from.html","date":1765880901000,"content":"<p>Ken Belson, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Every-Day-Sunday-Cultural-Juggernaut/dp/1538772558/ref=sr_1_1?crid=3N1LQJOD3I4A&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.FPPsXaTnFi2Dju8f0SWqfcA_FY1Jfivo0GFmGb642zLGjHj071QN20LucGBJIEps.OGlimjWvk4CRKrROBY8d_XaJ1biVXB3pNc7yDJYeVaw&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=every+day+is+sunday+by+ken+belson&amp;qid=1765819395&amp;sprefix=every+day+is+sunday%2Caps%2C338&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">Every Day is Sunday: </a><span>How Jerry Jones, Robert Kraft, and Roger Goodell Turned the NFL into a Cultural &amp; Economic Juggernaut.</span></p>\r\n<p>Tom MacTague, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Between-Waves-History-Revolution-1945-2016/dp/1529083095/ref=sr_1_1?crid=2ZBNSTL4KC42T&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.a0oSDm-bzQztrY9-4ofneFhWkh1_pBuukHmsZ85QqTTBwKyjdxqciB61vAsQxqBzuyqbGiZj6mQEbmLwa31ScqYz8tyU2g7L4_2i8hUZAN7H_MDpdcl0zImY38XS8rEIG6ilo32zzaxs0dYgkonacq01LwcJ1kah-lGzIoVFJ2waFwMfUn-VKhl6_5A6TqbA9pUHOl5agsXafSSDw3WBFeWLbKseXnKFec9I01MASy0.4jmmdsvQcpOjWrHxYwUBdvgBKyZsZ3m7D8sMmpTP6uE&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=between+the+waves&amp;qid=1765819460&amp;sprefix=between+the+wave%2Caps%2C572&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">Between the Waves: The Hidden History of a Very British Revolution 1945-2016</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Both are excellent.  I didn’t read the first one right off, because I do not care very much about the topic.  The book is good enough to overcome that problem.  I did not read the second one right off because I care about the topic a lot, but thought I already knew enough about it.  The book is good enough to overcome that problems.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/12/two-more-notable-books-from-2025.html\">Two more notable books from 2025</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/934880681/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/934880681/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/934880681/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/934880681/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/934880681/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/934880681/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/12/two-more-notable-books-from-2025.html#respond\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/12/two-more-notable-books-from-2025.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a><h3>Related Stories</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/12/gans-and-doctorow-on-ai-copyright.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=gans-and-doctorow-on-ai-copyright\">Gans and Doctorow on AI Copyright</a></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/12/ford-madox-ford-on-joseph-conrad.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=ford-madox-ford-on-joseph-conrad\">Ford Madox Ford on Joseph Conrad</a></li><li><a href